#              named "N more" for screen readers, `text-xs` beside `sm` avatars); an avatar marked
#              `data-here` takes a primary ring. Without `max` or `total` the group renders its
#              children as upstream (API-44).
#   formatting: the repository formatter (prettier defaults: semicolons, trailing commas)
#               reflows the file; those hunks carry no decision of their own.
